note DRA-292 release acceptance. Compose sha2.om json.om drv.om nodedrv.om then this unit.
note MODE BUILD OLD OMC40 ROUND40 OUTDIR [SCENARIO...]. Fake is host regression, not qualification.
note Memory caps await the reviewed prlimit host word; no host-language or external-tool substitute.
note A capped run deadline will be derived from a measured uncapped baseline (for example 3x)
note once the memory-cap scenario becomes runnable. Never classify an arbitrary timeout as a cap result.
